## 2. LeetCode #111 – Minimum Depth of Binary Tree

**Problem:** Find the minimum depth from the root node to the nearest leaf node.

**Concepts:** Recursion, DFS, Tree Depth

```java
class Solution {
    public int minDepth(TreeNode root) {
        if (root == null) {
            return 0;
        }

        if (root.left == null) {
            return 1 + minDepth(root.right);
        }

        if (root.right == null) {
            return 1 + minDepth(root.left);
        }

        return 1 + Math.min(
            minDepth(root.left),
            minDepth(root.right)
        );
    }
}
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(h), where h is the tree height.

