## 3. LeetCode #404 – Sum of Left Leaves

**Problem:** Find the sum of all left leaf nodes in a binary tree.

**Concepts:** Recursion, Tree Traversal

```java
class Solution {
    public int sumOfLeftLeaves(TreeNode root) {
        if (root == null) {
            return 0;
        }

        int sum = 0;

        if (root.left != null) {
            if (root.left.left == null &&
                root.left.right == null) {
                sum += root.left.val;
            } else {
                sum += sumOfLeftLeaves(root.left);
            }
        }

        sum += sumOfLeftLeaves(root.right);

        return sum;
    }
}
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(h)

